     <p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 20pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;">
</p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">金秋九月，硕果盈枝。在第</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">4</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">1个教师节到来之际，绍兴市第一中学满溢着感恩与敬意</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">向辛勤耕耘在教学、管理、服务一线的全体教职员工，致以节日的祝贺和崇高的敬意！</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>上级关怀暖人心，砥砺前行动力足</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">9月8日上午，绍兴市委书记施惠芳</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">市人大常委会副主任、市委秘书长马国灿，市政府副市长张雪，市教育局局长石剑晗一行莅临我校调研教育工作，走访慰问教师代表，为全体教师送来节日的问候与关怀。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">施惠芳充分肯定我校取得的成绩，并勉励</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">我校</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">以教育家精神铸魂强师</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">为绍兴教育高质量发展贡献更多一中力量。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>硕果盈枝载荣誉，匠心耕耘绽芳华</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">过去一学年，绍兴一中全体教师坚守育人初心，在教学、科研、竞赛等领域屡创佳绩，众多教师斩获市直级及以上</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">多项</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">荣誉，用实力诠释“学高为师，身正为范”的内涵。</span></p><p style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>集体与个人荣誉齐绽放，彰显一中实力</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2024-2025学年</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">学校集体荣誉</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">全国中小学科学教育实验校</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">全国第四届书香校园阅读教育教学成果案例</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2025年度浙江省教学成果奖（基础教育）一等奖</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2025-2026年度绍兴市中小学教育科研重点培育学校</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2024-2025学年教师</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">专业</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">/综合</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">荣誉</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">省正高级教师：张</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">  </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">叠</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">省教育科学研究优秀课题三等奖：杨国平</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">省心理健康教育教师专业技能大赛一等奖：王佩金</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">市“四有好老师”：陈</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">  </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">浩</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">市中小学教坛新秀：冯</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">  </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">莹</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">市中小学班主任基本功比赛二等奖：郭志威</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">市直中小学学科带头人：赵正瑜、沈剑蕾、王淑会</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">市直中小学教坛新秀：余栋材、刘军霞、邵张彬、陈忆宁</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2024-2025学年教学科研成果</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">   </span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">浙江省教学成果奖（基础教育）一等奖</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">蒋明、冯王亮、董烨华、余栋材、陈微微、赵正瑜</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">）</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">市教科规划课题立项</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">王劲慧、王燕、陈琦、张洁慧、沈剑蕾、俞一凡、张超、杨炀、陈龙珠、余栋材</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">）</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">市普通高中精品（推荐）选修课程</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">陶佳卉、徐冲越</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">）</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">   </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">市教科规划课题优秀成果</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">一等奖：翁鹏飞，二等奖：范捷</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">）</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2024-2025学年教学竞赛</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">成绩（</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">ppt图片展示</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">）</span></p><p style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">市直高中教学活动评审一等奖</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">夏帅波、俞定、傅红霞、茹奕蓓、孙舒曼、马作菁、施卡祥、沈洋铭、杨琼、孟玲燕、陈忆宁</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">）</span></p><p style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">市直高中学校专业阅读活动微讲座录像评比一等奖</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">徐立旦、韩韬</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">）</span></p><p style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>学科比武显身手，素养比拼拔头筹</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">在2025年绍兴市高中学校教师学科综合素养比武及市直高中教师学科综合素养比武中，我校教师凭借扎实的专业功底、出色的教学能力，在众多选手中脱颖而出，斩获多项荣誉：</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">市高中学校教师学科综合素养比武</span></p><p style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">一等奖：</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">金杰（数学）、陈华（数学）、彭爱波（政治）、张伟丰（地理）、周冰（化学）、沈洋铭（化学）</span></p><p style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">二等奖：</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">陈雪萍（语文）、</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">沈剑蕾（英语）、王芳芳（政治）、祝智浩（物理）、冯莹（化学）、陈依（生物）、沈岑（通用技术）、孟玲燕（信息技术）</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">市直高中学校教师学科综合素养比武</span></p><p style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">    </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">40周岁及以上排名前10%：</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">朱谷兰（语文）、吴巍巍（语文）、丁金美（数学）、骆永明（数学）、徐萍（数学）、钱虹燕（英语）、顾秀芳（英语）、彭爱波（政治）、张伟丰（地理）、邢婷（化学）、胡勇（化学）、丁泾芳（生物）、沈岑（通用技术）</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">    40周岁以下排名前10%：</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">金杰（数学）、金佳琳（数学）、陈华（数学）、傅芳芳（英语）、茹奕蓓（政治）、徐雯（地理）、赵正瑜（生物）、周冰（化学）、沈洋铭（化学）、翁天东（信息技术）</span></p><p style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>德育建设与班级</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>管理</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>结硕果</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">在班级管理与德育工作中，我校教师以爱心与责任心守护学生成长</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">市直优秀班集体：</span></p><p style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">高三（02）班（孙舒曼）、高三（03）班（廖</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">  </span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">烨）</span></p><p style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">高二（06）班（沈栋啸）、高二（14）班（骆永明）</span></p><p style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">高一（12）班（徐冲越）</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">市直德育优秀工作者：</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">陈美琴、徐立旦、马丹娜</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">市直优秀班主任：</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">朱谷兰、顾秀芳、陈忆宁</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">市直优秀工作者：</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">高</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">  </span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">英、刘明玉、王一行</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>师者风采展担当，深耕课堂育英才</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">荣誉的背后，是一中教师</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">们</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">对教学的精益求精、对学生的无私关爱。在日常教学中，他们以专业能力打造优质课堂，以敬业精神守护学生成长——</span></p><p style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>优质课堂，打造教学新高度</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">无论是精准高效的常规课，还是创新灵动的公开课，教师们始终以学生为中心，将学科知识与核心素养培养深度融合</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，以生动的课堂</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">为学生</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">成长</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">提供有效路径。</span></p><p style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>科研赋能，助力专业再成长</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">一中教师始终保持探索精神，将教学实践与理论研究相结合</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">聚焦教育教学痛点，为课堂改革提供实践参考</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，各学科组</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">凝聚团队</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">力量，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">对教育教学模式</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">持续</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">探索创新，为学校教育质量提升注入强劲动力。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>温情陪伴，守护成长每一步</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">课堂之外，班主任们以“爱生如子”的情怀，成为学生成长路上的“引路人”与“守护者”</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">以耐心与细心开展心理健康教育、德育活动，帮助学生树立正确的价值观，培养良好的行为习惯。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>饮水思源，致敬师恩</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">一支粉笔，两袖清风；三尺讲台，四季耕耘。绍兴一中的每一位教师，都在用平凡的坚守书写不平凡的教育人生</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">：</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">他们以扎实的学识、创新的教学方法和温暖的教育情怀，点亮学生求知的道路，展现新时代教师的专业风采与责任担当。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>在这个充满敬意的节日里，学校谨向全体教师致以最崇高的敬意：感谢你们以智慧启迪心灵，以爱心温暖成长，以责任照亮未来！</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><section><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>衷心祝愿全体教师节日快乐、身体健康、工作顺利、阖家幸福！</strong></span></section></p><p></p><p>
</p><p><section><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>衷心祝愿绍兴一中教育集团的育人事业蒸蒸日上，再创辉煌！</strong></span></section><section><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>衷心感谢社会各界一直以来对绍兴一中教育集团的关心与支持！</strong></span></section></p><p></p><p>
</p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span>
</p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: right;">
</p>
    
